ALS and Healthy animal data
.mat files contain 3 things
1) rat#number: Contains Z-spectra data of size (64x64x89x2) for 89 frequency offsets and B_1 powers of 0.5uT and 1uT

2) rat#number_R1map: R1 map of size (64x64)

3) rat#numer_fm: Pool size ratio (PSR) or fm maps of size (64x64)

These will be required for performing most analysis in CEST imaging. 
